{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0669ab157435cf7655869c6106dd1d4004ac9f4581528aae6312837119feaa31", "ja": "（今日は、『プリムラ』に合わせたPVの撮影で、\n大きな公園に来ている。今は、休憩時間だ……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄搭配『报春花』的PV，\n我们今天来到大型公园。现在是休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "ce1dcb2266ff4fed9f8fbbbc8aaf6a431aeacdc0b40832f263d66dbc1f71ba3e", "ja": "すっげー！？　{$P$}、\n公園の中にカフェまであるよ！　オシャレだな～。", "zh": "好强喔！？{$P$}，\n公园里连咖啡厅都有耶！感觉好时尚喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9525cb7ce4d03b1910d6f1798009d4b82e95052aa0928a2c2f92a293c5fa0439", "ja": "流石、雰囲気がいいな。\n湖も広いし、いいPVが撮れそうだ。", "zh": "这里的气氛还真不错，\n湖面也够辽阔，感觉能拍出很棒的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "f031e9c9282beb38d6be78a7a239f8ad0e70a694bfb79d5dd4a701df96fed6e9", "ja": "緑がいっぱいで、気持ちいいしな♪\nどんなPVになるのか、ワクワクするぜ！", "zh": "而且附近都是绿色植物，让人很舒畅呢♪\n好期待会拍出什么样的PV喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "7541c6a87a0b442860ec86beff40261cfd33e1cc7bf4e9eb9955d04648710fa1", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}は、\nプリムラの花言葉って知ってる？", "zh": "对了！{$P$}，\n你知道报春花的花语吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "eaba6f91807338346cebdda875b0b9d9fc0411fb467530823f7ecd511356bd63", "ja": "そういえば、音無さんが何か言ってたけど……\n結局聞いてないな。昴、知ってるのか？", "zh": "这么说来，音无小姐好像有说过……\n但结果我没听到。昴，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "854dd664cb369a217bc59ad6bc5ee12b92bb1b203db8d86cef278252f4b62f04", "ja": "知ってるぜ！　こないだ小鳥が教えてくれたんだ。\n『青春』とか、『初恋』とかだって。", "zh": "知道啊！之前小鸟告诉过我。\n她说是『青春』、『初恋』之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "a15fa06bd911e8b37d79b33a3efbfb1f92ece1a52a90a99edd0d2ca17a9b4751", "ja": "他にもいろんな意味があるんだって。\nそれでオレ、ちょっと気になったんだけど……。", "zh": "听说还有很多意义，\n所以我就有点好奇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "c4eb5dac8917d7c18f07d5abdf4e3705d29ff41a3d07f84550286ea922150c59", "ja": "{$P$}って、初恋したことある？\nなぁ、教えてくれよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，你有过初恋吗？\n欸，告诉我啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "19445e4478c7776ee139853b2431ac8cd0b2ef6392d741d21059cf15bde2794f", "ja": "お、俺の初恋の話か？\nうーん、そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "你、你问我的初恋吗？\n唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "70f537ac3d3bf23333f068235f273392ac2bef4ac95621feaeca5040a2e38a04", "ja": "オレ、もっと恋の話が聞いてみたいんだ。\n小鳥が話してくれたみたいなやつ！", "zh": "我想听更多恋爱话题，\n就像小鸟跟我说的那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "56a0df746d2e2af70bb07089ec94441b61936141279383d383a5aca30187d2cf", "ja": "やっぱ{$P$}も、\nこういうカフェとかでデートしたのか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你也在这种咖啡厅约过会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7b87a98b5d90daf814caaf956a3fe225273c8390a1a4b3c7d7cc89eb46e99784", "ja": "そ、そうだな……デート……みたいなものを、\nした事が、あったかもしれないな……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛……\n我应该算是有过类似……约会……的经验啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "4732613c20b180764ebd5aedd32fab9bf301579ec43bbe1e328e4731f3017a5b", "ja": "すっげー！　こんなオシャレなトコでデートなんて、\n{$P$}、やっぱ大人だな♪", "zh": "好厉害！竟然在这么时尚的地方约会，\n{$P$}果然是成熟的大人呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "7a704e30671a0fd6c80297e0ed51f0113b528f426a5c296780f68f35c6239730", "ja": "あっ、見てよ{$P$}！　このカフェ、\n季節のケーキが人気なんだって！　ウマそ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，你看！这家咖啡厅的\n当季蛋糕好像很受欢迎！看起来好好吃～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8311c0b184ae9bc3e24e303beb8c27e409953738122388b73f59a4a43bae4f6a", "ja": "お、本当だな。せっかくだから、食べて行くか？\nみんなも呼んで。", "zh": "喔，真的耶。难得都来了，要不要吃了再走？\n也把大家都叫来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "453f447ab5a4153881b7a9d4c8dd3b53d95bef4d59515a1bcd929a433735e027", "ja": "いいの！？　やった♪\nオレ、静香と百合子呼んでくる！", "zh": "可以吗！？太好了♪\n我去叫静香和百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1c3a09d4ec27ffeea2e4d5247b2b6fd3f52abc55242b1b721a809e544bfc51f1", "ja": "それなら、俺が呼びに行ってくるよ。\n昴は中で待ってて……。", "zh": "那让我去叫吧，\n昴你在里面等……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "2311888793ac541c535fda1d3f2eede8ac3405e0907c1571fa297592fb027c49", "ja": "いいからいいから、{$P$}が\n先に入って、席取っといて！", "zh": "没关系啦，{$P$}，\n你先进去占位子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "881a1a0d29bb303531010d5d57501985e2e5a08901e0ac56597c6d3227e719d4", "ja": "オレ、こんなオシャレな店に、ひとりでなんか\n絶対入れないし……だから！", "zh": "因为我一定没办法一个人走进这么时尚的店……\n所以说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "e6cab2d7e53b7c74bdcc6613a0d02fcb86db6686611f6a9913f387aaf98b43e4", "ja": "ケーキが売り切れないように、見張っててくれよな♪\nじゃ、行ってくるぜ！", "zh": "你快去看着，别让蛋糕卖完啦♪\n那我去去就回！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0103_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e3f83077564de12832c5aa2ce5850c0e63d6bb21997d4edf38c971c53c98b66b", "ja": "（恋に興味はあるものの、昴はまだまだ\n色気より食い気……かな！）", "zh": "（虽然对恋爱话题有兴趣，\n但比起恋爱，昴还是对吃更感兴趣吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
